# Cloudflare Pages Function environment variables (set as an encrypted
# secret on the Pages project — Dashboard > Settings > Environment variables,
# or via the Cloudflare API/Terraform once nesso-infra codifies it).
#
# Required by functions/mcp.ts (the /mcp agent-tools endpoint) to call the
# flyitalyadsb v2 REST API (api.flyitalyadsb.com/v2/*). Provisioning is a
# manual step — ask for a key to be issued in Infisical, there's no
# Terraform-managed path for this specific role. Without it, /mcp still
# serves `initialize`/`tools/list`, but every `tools/call` returns a clear
# isError result instead of a real answer.
FLYITALYADSB_V2_API_KEY=
